{"id":1660,"date":"2015-10-30T00:05:36","date_gmt":"2015-10-30T07:05:36","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/?p=1660"},"modified":"2015-10-30T00:05:36","modified_gmt":"2015-10-30T07:05:36","slug":"marin-amateur-radio-society-mars-christmas-party-invite","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2015\/10\/30\/marin-amateur-radio-society-mars-christmas-party-invite\/","title":{"rendered":"Marin Amateur Radio Society (MARS) Christmas Party invite"},"content":{"rendered":"<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<p>All are cordially invited to attend the MARS Christmas Party on <span class=\"aBn\" tabindex=\"0\" data-term=\"goog_2082568207\"><span class=\"aQJ\">Wednesday, December 16, 2015<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<p>WHEN: December 16, 2015 17:30 (5:30 PM) -Dinner at 6:30<\/p>\n<p>Planned Menu:<br \/>\nSalad, Turkey, Ham, Whipped<br \/>\nPotatoes, Green Beans, Bread,<br \/>\nDeserts, Appetizers<\/p>\n<p>WHERE: MARS Clubhouse, 27 Shell Rd, Mill Valley, CA 94941<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>COST: $25.00<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">You need to RSVP by November 30th:<\/span>\u00a0 <a href=\"mailto:rsvp@w6sg.net\" target=\"_blank\">rsvp@w6sg.net<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Best regards,<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>Randy Jenkins, KA6BQF<\/div>\n<div><a href=\"mailto:ka6bqf@arrl.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span class=\"il\">ka6bqf@arrl.net<\/span><\/a><\/div>\n<div>510 526.4089 or 707 557.5521<\/div>\n<div>Treasurer, East Bay Amateur Radio Club<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>All are cordially invited to attend the MARS Christmas Party on Wednesday, December 16, 2015 WHEN: December 16, 2015 17:30 (5:30 PM) -Dinner at 6:30 Planned Menu: Salad, Turkey, Ham, <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2015\/10\/30\/marin-amateur-radio-society-mars-christmas-party-invite\/\">Continue Reading &rarr;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template